		== Miscellanea

		I am the author of the _Exh_ Python package for automating the computation of innocent-exclusion exhaustification.

		- Exh for Python.\
		  #bracketlink("PyPI", "https://pypi.org/project/Exh/") #bracketlink("GitHub", "https://github.com/KenyC/Exh")\
